{"title": "Unstable Ballistics (Condition)", "pageid": 33067, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Unstable_Ballistics_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Threat Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Unstable Ballistics</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>This grenade will explode immediately when interacted with. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">WYR_GORTASH_GRENADE_HARDCORE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WYR_GORTASH_GRENADE_HARDCORE+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WYR_GORTASH_GRENADE_HARDCORE+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Unstable_Ballistics\">Sources of Unstable Ballistics</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Affects <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concussion_Grenade\" title=\"Concussion Grenade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concussion_Grenade\" title=\"Concussion Grenade\">Concussion Grenade</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_Mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour Mode\">Honour</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> Modes.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><i>\"Interacted with\"</i> is construed very broadly. The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) (Condition)\">Invulnerable</a> condition from a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Globe_of_Invulnerability\" title=\"Globe of Invulnerability\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/25px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/38px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/50px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Globe of Invulnerability\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/25px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Globe_of_Invulnerability\" title=\"Globe of Invulnerability\">Globe of Invulnerability</a> is enough to set an affected grenade off instantly.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203304\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1525/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15835/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7168/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1038856/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.403      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   51.403      1 -total\n 38.30%   19.686      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 15.41%    7.922      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 14.31%    7.357      1 Template:RarityItem\n 13.37%    6.872      3 Template:Template_style\n 13.18%    6.775      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.08%    5.694      1 Template:Cond\n  9.09%    4.672      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.73%    4.488     19 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:33067-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203304 and revision id 396025. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}